meta {
  name: Get session profile context
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/:id/profile/context
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:path {
  id: claude-code:<rootUuid>
}

docs {
  Prompt-context pressure for a session. Accepts NO query parameters (any
  parameter, `scope` included, is a `400` naming it).

  Returns `{ view: "context", sessionId, own, tree, descendants }`. `own` covers
  the session's own `kind='call'` steps; `tree` pools the same rows across the
  whole recursive subtree. Each metric object is
  `{ observedCalls, promptInput, avgPromptInput, p95PromptInput, peakPromptInput,
  cacheReadShare }`.

  A call is observable when at least one of `uncached_input` / `cached_input` /
  `cache_write` is present; missing categories then count as 0, and an all-NULL
  prompt-input call is excluded. Every metric field is `null` when `observedCalls`
  is 0; `cacheReadShare` is additionally `null` at a zero prompt-input denominator.

  `descendants` carries one own-only row per descendant, ordered depth-first
  parent-before-child (siblings by `startedAt` ASC, NULL first, then id). A
  missing session is `404`; a malformed id is `400`.
}
